    "created_at": "2017-09-25T19:53:24Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-09-25T19:53:24Z",
    "body": "> What is the expected outcome of the current transform in the case we are throwing? Should it have been reset?\r\n\r\nYes because the reset step comes before 'creating a DOMMatrix from a dictionary' which is the part that throws.\r\n\r\n> Since the argument is optional, should setTransform() with no parameters just reset the transform?\r\n\r\nI think so, otherwise the argument should not be optional (has no purpose).  +1 for clarifying the spec about this.",
