    "created_at": "2017-09-25T20:23:40Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-09-25T20:23:40Z",
    "body": "I think we should reorder the steps such that when it throws, the current transformation matrix is not reset.\r\n\r\nNo arguments is equivalent to specifying `{}` per Web IDL, i.e. identity matrix. Dictionary arguments without required members have to be optional per Web IDL.",
